'''Li'l Nyandam''' (コニャンダム ''Ko Nyandamu'', '''Kid Nyandam''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy found in [[Saint Red Fox]], the final stage of [[Dead End Night]]. When defeated, he may join the player as a [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cat]] - [[Li'l Nyandam (Special Cat)|Li'l Nyandam]]. He was added in [[Version 3.5 Update|Version 3.5]].

